P2       ROUTE 1 -- THE RATE ROUTE: the crossing attempt Path A had never made
         S_n = -Vol*n*sigma   (CS_n = 0 by P1)
         log|tors_n| ~ n log(phi^2)
         log|tors| / (-S) = 2*log(phi)/(Vol*sigma)   -- the n CANCELS: a pure number over sigma
         SO: IF log|H_1 tors| = -S (an entropy-equals-action statement), THEN
           sigma = log(phi^2)/vol(m004) = 0.4741275971155
           c = 6 sigma                  = 2.8447655826933
         THE SEAL PRINTED THESE TWO NUMBERS IN ADVANCE, so they cannot be
         presented as a discovery.  They are a CANDIDATE, and the cell's job
         is to find whether the identification that produces them is licensed.
         WHAT THE LICENCE WOULD HAVE TO BE, stated so it is checkable:
           a named result letting log|H_1(M_n)_tors| be read as the entropy of
           the gravitational theory on M_n, equal to minus its on-shell action.
         WHY IT IS NOT LICENSED -- and this is THIS SEAT'S ARGUMENT FROM THE
         STRUCTURE OF THE THEORY, not a citation.  A literature check is in flight
         at the time of banking and is NOT reflected here; if it returns a licence,
         this cell is wrong and the arc owes an addendum.  Flagged, not hidden:
           torsion enters a complex-CS partition function as RAY-SINGER torsion at
           ONE LOOP (Cheeger-Muller; Witten; Dimofte-Gukov-Lenells-Zagier), i.e. in
           the FLUCTUATION determinant, NOT in the on-shell action; and a cusped
           hyperbolic manifold has NO HORIZON, so there is no Bekenstein-Hawking
           area to count and no Cardy regime to sit in.  Reading a HOMOLOGY count
           as a STATE count is a category error, not a missing theorem.
         licence found: False
